# The Barrens (Alliance) - Completionist (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Alliance addendum to the Horde route: the 13 Alliance-acceptable Barrens
# accepts the Horde census set aside (docs/barrens-alliance-census.md;
# contract the-barrens-alliance, order 81). Levels 1-47 by the data (min1
# chicken 3861 and min4 Shaman link 94375, min15-25 middle, min30 top:
# the Theramore chain, the warlock Tome, Gnome Engineering).
# Every addendum accept appears exactly once as an accept and once as a
# turnin. Chain order is strictly turn-in-before-accept in file order.
# Out-of-contract pres (1039 darnassus-city, 1286 dustwallow-marsh, 1716
# and 1798 stormwind-city, 6981 the-barrens main guide, 94374 dun-morogh)
# ride dedicated when onquest mini-steps, each standing alone in its own
# step; out-of-contract chain exits (1041 stranglethorn-vale, 1259/1319/
# 1288 dustwallow-marsh, 1739/65603 stormwind-city, 1802/3640
# ironforge-city) get handoff notes, never duplication. Expedition legs
# (Ashenvale, Stormwind, Ironforge, Dun Morogh, Darnassus, Dustwallow,
# Booty Bay) switch frames deliberately and switch back. Coordinates use
# data-placed points only; sourceless objectives ride bag notes, never
# invented points. The 3370 turn-in rides Darnassus per the data (the
# round brief's Alterac leg is corrected in the census).
guide butler-routes-completionist/the-barrens-alliance
title The Barrens (Alliance) - Completionist
levels 1-47
zone The Barrens
faction Alliance
category Leveling
folder Completionist
coords live
version 1

step Ratchet - bounties and the chicken

  zone map 1413

  note Ratchet work with no outside pre: Bainham's ravener, Tinkerwiz below in its own skill step, and the chicken.
  accept 97005 -- Chol'aruk the Ravener - Bainham; the ravener works the north-center flats (kill leg below)
  accept 3861 -- CLUCK! - the chicken at Ratchet (60.76,55.49); have a Special Chicken Feed in your bags - Farmer Saldean in Westfall sells it
  complete 3861 @60.76,55.49 -- Special Chicken Feed (the Ratchet chicken; /cheer per the quest text, then the feed)
  turnin 3861 @60.76,55.49 -- CLUCK! - the word to the befriended chicken

step Ratchet - Gnome Engineering (profession)

  zone map 1413

  when skill Engineering 1

  accept 3634 optional -- Gnome Engineering - Tinkerwiz; Tinkmaster Overspark in Ironforge takes the pledge (next 3640 Ironforge, not contracted here)

step Ratchet - Dizzywig's passage (soft pre)

  zone map 1413

  when onquest 1039

  note Holding 1039 (The Barrens Port, from Thyn'tel in Teldrassil - darnassus-city's): Dizzywig takes the Booty Bay word here.
  accept 1040 -- Passage to Booty Bay - Wharfmaster Dizzywig; take the boat word for Caravaneer Ruzzgot (needs 1039 darnassus-city first - take its warning if it is not done)

step Ratchet - Strahad's tome (soft pre)

  zone map 1413

  when onquest 1798

  note Holding 1798 (Seeking Strahad, from Stormwind - stormwind-city's): Strahad takes the cabal word here.
  accept 1758 only Warlock -- Tome of the Cabal - Strahad Farsan; Krom Stoutarm in Ironforge takes it (needs 1798 stormwind-city first - take its warning if it is not done)

step Takar - the warlock pair, first link (soft pre)

  zone map 1413

  when onquest 1716

  note Holding 1716 (Devourer of Souls, from Gakin in Stormwind - stormwind-city's): Takar takes both warlock words here.
  accept 1738 only Warlock -- Heartswood - Takar the Seer; the Heartswood waits in Ashenvale (needs 1716 stormwind-city first - take its warning if it is not done)

step Takar - the warlock pair, second link (soft pre)

  zone map 1413

  when onquest 1716

  accept 65602 only Warlock -- What Is Love? - Takar the Seer; the Wooden Figurine waits in Ashenvale (needs 1716 stormwind-city first - take its warning if it is not done)

step Falla - nightmares (soft pre)

  zone map 1413

  when onquest 6981

  note Holding 6981 (The Glowing Shard, the-barrens main guide's): Falla takes the nightmare word here - the Alliance twin of 3369, which stays the main guide's.
  accept 3370 -- In Nightmares - Falla Sagewind; Mathrengyl Bearwalker in Darnassus takes the shard (needs 6981 the-barrens first - take its warning if it is not done)

step North-center flats - the ravener's head

  zone map 1413

  note North from Falla to the ravener grounds for Bainham's bounty.
  complete 97005 @57.18,28.79 -- Chol'aruk (north-center flats; also 56.96,26.19 and 57.68,27.38)
  turnin 97005 @61.88,39.44 -- Chol'aruk the Ravener - the head to Bainham at Ratchet

step Far south - the Theramore chain

  zone map 1413

  note South past Takar to the Thousand Needles lift road: the badge, the shield and the hoofprints lie together.
  accept 1252 -- Lieutenant Paval Reethe - Theramore Guard Badge; Captain Garran Vimes in Theramore takes the badge (take 1302 wetlands or 1282 dustwallow-marsh first - one of the pair is required)
  accept 1253 -- The Black Shield - the Black Shield; Vimes in Theramore takes it (take 1302 wetlands or 1282 dustwallow-marsh first - one of the pair is required)
  accept 1284 -- Suspicious Hoofprints - the Hoofprints; Vimes in Theramore takes the word (take 1282 dustwallow-marsh or 1302 wetlands first - one of the pair is required)

step Far south - Balos (soft pre)

  zone map 1413

  when onquest 1286

  note Holding 1286 (The Deserters, from Vimes in Theramore - dustwallow-marsh's): Balos takes the deserter word here.
  accept 1287 -- The Deserters - Balos Jacken; Vimes in Theramore takes it (needs 1286 dustwallow-marsh first - take its warning if it is not done)

step East Barrens - the manifestation (soft pre)

  zone map 1413

  when onquest 94374

  note Holding 94374 (Call of Earth, from Teo Hammerstorm in Dun Morogh - dun-morogh's): the manifestation takes the earth word here.
  accept 94375 only Shaman -- Call of Earth - Minor Manifestation of Earth; have the Rough Quartz (item 6656, no placed source in the data) in your bags - Teo in Anvilmar takes it (needs 94374 dun-morogh first - take its warning if it is not done)

step Ashenvale expedition - Heartswood (soft pre)

  zone map 1440

  when onquest 1716

  note North over the border into Ashenvale for the warlock completes; the frame switches on.
  complete 1738 only Warlock @31.55,31.57 -- Heartswood (Ashenvale)
  tip Expedition leg to Ashenvale; the frame switches on.

  zone map 1413

step Ashenvale expedition - the figurine (soft pre)

  zone map 1440

  when onquest 1716

  complete 65602 only Warlock @26.61,22.03 -- Wooden Figurine (Ashenvale)
  tip Expedition leg to Ashenvale; the frame switches on.

  zone map 1413

step Stormwind expedition - Gakin's bindings

  zone Stormwind City

  when onquest 1716

  note East to Stormwind to close the warlock pair; the frame switches on.
  turnin 1738 only Warlock @39.22,85.23 -- Heartswood - the Heartswood to Gakin the Darkbinder
  turnin 65602 only Warlock @39.22,85.23 -- What Is Love? - the figurine to Gakin the Darkbinder
  note 1738's next (1739, The Binding) and 65602's next (65603, The Binding) both accept from Gakin - stormwind-city's, not contracted here.
  tip Expedition leg to Stormwind; the frame switches on.

  zone map 1413

