step Darnassus expedition - Mathrengyl's shard

  zone Darnassus

  when onquest 6981

  note North to Darnassus with the nightmare shard; the frame switches on.
  turnin 3370 @35.37,8.4 -- In Nightmares - the shard to Mathrengyl Bearwalker
