  turnin 1252 @68.21,48.62 -- Lieutenant Paval Reethe - the badge to Captain Garran Vimes
  turnin 1253 @68.21,48.62 -- The Black Shield - the shield to Captain Garran Vimes
  turnin 1284 @68.21,48.62 -- Suspicious Hoofprints - the word to Captain Garran Vimes
  note 1252's next (1259) and 1253's next (1319) both accept from Vimes - dustwallow-marsh's, not contracted here.
