step Booty Bay expedition - Ruzzgot's boat

  zone Stranglethorn Vale

  when onquest 1039

  note South by boat to Booty Bay to close the passage; the frame switches on.
  turnin 1040 @27.37,74.08 -- Passage to Booty Bay - the word to Caravaneer Ruzzgot
  note 1040's next (1041) accepts from Ruzzgot - stranglethorn-vale's, not contracted here. The addendum ends here.
